{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stranded on a strange island where ancient hostile forces lurk in the shadows, you must survive, explore... and find your way home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scavenge for water, food, shelter. Battle disease, exhaustion, and despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forage, mine, fish, cook\u2014but also fight. Craft equipment to gain unique Power Dice (wood/silver/gold), swaying your fate in critical moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key actions\u2014especially combat\u2014are resolved through dice rolls. Forge gear tailored to each challenge, and outmaneuver dangers in a living world ruled by day/night cycles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What secrets does this island hold? What are you truly fleeing? And how far will you go to survive?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Struggle to survive in a hostile environment and find a way back to civilization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the island and gather resources to meet vital needs while avoiding disease, exhaustion, or despair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your camp to improve rest, healing, and survival conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft equipment to obtain Power Dice (Wood/Silver/Gold) suited for every challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover secrets of an island both beautiful and eerie, shaped by day-night cycles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reveal the truth behind your arrival, the hero\u2019s intentions, and the shadows of their past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face enemies in turn-based combat where strategy and dice decide your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Dice or Die</i> offers unique tabletop-inspired gameplay.<br>Most critical actions are resolved by dice rolls, adding uncertainty to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire these Power Dice through equipment\u2014crafted in wood, silver, or gold tiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1278860?t=1753578066","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1278860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753578066","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1278860/b876f2affa82e88f4f12f7adaee6fad70eded2a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753578066","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1278860/b876f2affa82e88f4f12f7adaee6fad70eded2a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753578066","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stranded on a strange island where ancient hostile forces lurk in the shadows, you must survive, explore... and find your way home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scavenge for water, food, shelter. Battle disease, exhaustion, and despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forage, mine, fish, cook\u2014but also fight. Craft equipment to gain unique Power Dice (wood/silver/gold), swaying your fate in critical moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key actions\u2014especially combat\u2014are resolved through dice rolls. Forge gear tailored to each challenge, and outmaneuver dangers in a living world ruled by day/night cycles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What secrets does this island hold? What are you truly fleeing? And how far will you go to survive?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Struggle to survive in a hostile environment and find a way back to civilization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the island and gather resources to meet vital needs while avoiding disease, exhaustion, or despair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your camp to improve rest, healing, and survival conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft equipment to obtain Power Dice (Wood/Silver/Gold) suited for every challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover secrets of an island both beautiful and eerie, shaped by day-night cycles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reveal the truth behind your arrival, the hero\u2019s intentions, and the shadows of their past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face enemies in turn-based combat where strategy and dice decide your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Dice or Die</i> offers unique tabletop-inspired gameplay.<br>Most critical actions are resolved by dice rolls, adding uncertainty to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire these Power Dice through equipment\u2014crafted in wood, silver, or gold tiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Slyt Digital"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1278860/713ed69524256d6ce2f2dc796c1a061b54054654/header.jpg?t=1753578066","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256800672,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256800672/movie480.mp4?t=1599879215","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256800672/movie_max.mp4?t=1599879215"},"name":"Di[c]E - Dice or Die - Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a